* <Natural Source Header
/*******************************************************************************
/*  Software AG - Entire Output Management
/*  Group:    Monitor
/*  Module:   RMGTRACN
/*  Template:
/*
/*  Function:
/** Returns the current trace settings to #TRACING and +TRACE*  **/
/*
/** Last :author fhi
/*
/*******************************************************************************
/*  Maintenance
/*******************************************************************************
/*  User ID   yyyy-mm-dd Issue         Remark
/* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*  fhi       2015-05-06 NOMALL-1585   Written to avoid usage of GDA
/************************************* data ************************************
DEFINE DATA
PARAMETER
1 #TRACING                (L) OPTIONAL
INDEPENDENT
1 +TRACE-WRAP             (I2)
1 +TRACE-PROG             (A8)    /* NOMALL-1585 fhi in
LOCAL
1 L-NATRP-ERC             (N4)
1 L-NATRP-ERT             (A250)
END-DEFINE
/************************************* main ************************************
IF #TRACING SPECIFIED
  PERFORM RMGTRACX-GET-VALUES
    L-NATRP-ERC
    L-NATRP-ERT
    #TRACING
ELSE
  PERFORM RMGTRACX-GET-VALUES
    L-NATRP-ERC
    L-NATRP-ERT
END-IF
*
END
/************************************* end *************************************
